[00:09.69]He wore such little pants
{"他穿着超短裤"}
[00:11.50]His brother was a champion
{"他的兄弟是冠军"}
[00:13.40]But kiki loves to dance
{"但奇奇最爱跳舞"}
[00:22.64]The second man was chuchu
{"第二个男人叫楚楚"}
[00:24.45]A master of romance
{"浪漫情场高手"}
[00:26.30]He loved Damsels In Distress but not as much as dance
{"他爱落难少女但更爱跳舞"}
[00:37.37]And then one day it happened
{"直到某天来临"}
[00:39.22]They went off to the world
{"他们闯荡世界"}
[00:41.06]They went on to a journey
{"他们踏上旅程"}
[00:42.73]Idolized by the boys and girls
{"成为少男少女的偶像"}
[00:44.77]They learn so many lessons
