[00:46.64]In all of the foreign lands
{"走过所有陌生国度"}
[00:48.41]But no matter where they wandered
{"但无论漂泊何处"}
[00:50.16]They never stopped the dance
{"他们从未停止舞步"}
[00:59.76]One day inside station
{"某日在车站里"}
[01:01.38]In Amsterdam perchance
{"或许在阿姆斯特丹"}
[01:03.25]The men were dancing side by side by a man with crooked glance
{"两人并肩跳舞时遇见斜眼男子"}
[01:06.94]They turn to face each other
