[01:10.64]That these two men would meet that day and do their fateful dance
{"命运让两人相遇并跳起宿命之舞"}
[01:14.56]"WOW, you can really dance"
{"哇 你跳得真棒"}
[01:18.25]"WOW, you can really dance"
{"哇 你跳得真棒"}
[01:21.18]He went
{"他走了"}
[01:23.07]He went*2
{"他走了*2"}
