{"他们说我们一直共舞至今 多么奇妙的巧合"}
[01:36.69]And then they dance together
{"随后他们一同起舞"}
[01:38.35]Like no one dance before
{"前所未有地舞动"}
[01:40.17]The diplomat were dancing
{"外交官们翩然起舞"}
[01:41.98]They cancelled orders of the war(no more)
